llow flare","href":"/item/:mode/rsp-30-reactive-signal-cartridge-yellow","title":"RSP-30 reactive signal cartridge (Yellow)","type":"link"},{"content":", make sure to aim it upwards, but not too much or it lands behind you. Finally, you have to extract via the \"Cliff Descent\" extraction. To use it, a ","type":"text"},{"content":"Red Rebel ice pick","href":"/item/:mode/red-rebel-ice-pick","title":"Red Rebel ice pick","type":"link"},{"content":" and ","type":"text"},{"content":"Paracord","href":"/item/:mode/paracord","title":"Paracord","type":"link"},{"content":" are required and you must not wear any ","type":"text"},{"content":"Armor vest","href":"https://escapefromtarkov.fandom.com/wiki/Armor_vest","title":"Armor vest","type":"link"},{"content":".\n","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"variant":"gallery","items":[[{"content":"\n\t\t\t","type":"text"},{"alt":"Flare area marked on map","previewSrc":"/api/wiki/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.wikia.nocookie.net%2Fescapefromtarkov_gamepedia%2Fimages%2F9%2F97%2FPaybackFlareMap.png%2Frevision%2Flatest%3Fcb%3D20230121203356","src":"/api/wiki/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.wikia.nocookie.net%2Fescapefromtarkov_gamepedia%2Fimages%2F9%2F97%2FPaybackFlareMap.png%2Frevision%2Flatest%2Fscale-to-width-down%2F427%3Fcb%3D20230121203356","type":"image"},{"content":"\n\t\t\t","type":"text"},{"content":"Flare area marked on map","type":"text"},{"content":"\n\t\t","type":"text"}]],"ordered":false,"type":"list"}],"images":[{"src":"/api/wiki/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.wikia.nocookie.net%2Fescapefromtarkov_gamepedia%2Fimages%2F9%2F97%2FPaybackFlareMap.png%2Frevision%2Flatest%2Fscale-to-width-down%2F427%3Fcb%3D20230121203356","previewSrc":"/api/wiki/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.wikia.nocookie.net%2Fescapefromtarkov_gamepedia%2Fimages%2F9%2F97%2FPaybackFlareMap.png%2Frevision%2Flatest%3Fcb%3D20230121203356","alt":"Flare area marked on map"}],"nextQuests":[{"id":"63966ff54c3ef01b6f3ffad8","name":"Provocation","normalizedName":"provo